--- [3] KIEM CHUNG PHAT HIEN 1: LENH TRANSFER BI KHOA GAS 2300 ---
  * Vi EOA thong thuong nhan ETH: Tieu ton 21.000 gas -> Chuyen thanh cong ca 2 cach.
  * Vi Smart Contract (Safe Multisig / AA Wallet / Proxy):
    - Ham receive() kem ghi log hoac proxy routing: Tieu ton ~4.500 - 7.000 gas.
    - Su dung payable.transfer(): Gioi han 2.300 gas -> REVERT Out of Gas! Tien coc bi giam.
    - Su dung .call{value: ...}(''): Khong gioi han gas cung -> CHUYEN TIEN THANH CONG!

--- [4] TONG KET 10 HANG MUC KIEM TRA BAT BUOC THEO SO TAY LAB 14 ---
  [Trung binh ] 1. Phan quyen         : setPenaltyRate quen modifier onlyManager
  [Trung binh ] 2. Thu tu thao tac    : refundDeposit vi pham CEI truoc lenh transfer
  [Nhe        ] 3. Dieu kien thoi gian: Chua xu ly truong hop moc bien thoi gian bang 0
  [Trung binh ] 4. Phep chia & so hoc : Chia 24 truoc khi nhan overdueHours lam tron 0
  [Nghiem trong] 5. Cach chuyen ETH    : Dung payable.transfer gay ket tien coc voi vi SC
  [Nhe        ] 6. Du lieu rieng tu   : Luu cabinetPin private tren chain khong bao mat
  [Nghiem trong] 7. Vong lap danh sach : getBorrowerTotalDevices duyet mang orders khong gioi han
  [Nhe        ] 8. Ghi nhan su kien   : Thieu phat su kien khi khau tru tien phat
  [Trung binh ] 9. Truong hop so 0    : Chua chan msg.value == 0 khi muon do
  [Nhe        ] 10. Dia chi rong      : Constructor chua chan manager != address(0)

